=2 Walkthrough
* Easily soloable mission.
* After confirming the mission with {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}, go to a Windurstian controlled {p:Campaign} area and talk to the {p:Gate Sentry}.

----
=3 List of Gate Sentries
* {z:West Sarutabaruta (S)}: (I-4)
* {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)}: (K-11)
* {z:Fort Karugo-Narugo (S)}: (E-11)

* Your mission is to escort an NPC named "Reinforcement" to the {p:Campaign NPC|Category:Campaign NPC} of the zone.
** If you get too far away from the NPC, she will say a line of dialogue and proceed to run on her own back towards the Gate Sentry.
** You can regain control of the NPC by talking to her again.

=3 List of Campaign NPCs
* {z:West Sarutabaruta (S)}: (H-6)
* {z:Fort Karugo-Narugo (S)}: {n:Lamurara, C.C.} at (H-8) inside Fivespires (Not on the main map.)

----
* Once you've arrived at the {p:Campaign NPC|Category:Campaign NPC}, the mission will end, you will receive the experience points and you will be told to report back to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}.
** If a {p:campaign battle|Campaign battle} is currently in progress, the NPC will stand there, but not despawn. You will have to wait for it to finish for the mission to be counted as a success.
* After talking to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}, you gain the {p:Allied Notes} and the mission is complete.

